---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — SuretyResearch" description="SuretyResearch privacy policy.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container article" style="max-width: 720px;">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you use our bond cost calculator, we collect the selections you make (bond type, amount, credit range) but do not require personal information for estimates. When you request a quote or contact us, we collect the information you provide: name, email, phone, and bond details.</p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>Quote requests are shared with our recommended bond provider, Cornerstone Licensing, to prepare your bond quote. We do not sell your information to third parties or use it for purposes other than providing the services you request.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and Analytics</h2>
      <p>We use basic analytics to understand site usage. This data is aggregated and does not personally identify you. We do not use tracking cookies for advertising.</p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>All form submissions are transmitted over encrypted connections (HTTPS). We use industry-standard security measures to protect your information.</p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information at any time by contacting us.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, visit our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .article h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .article h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .article p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; }
</style>
